# Twenty levels rather than GMS's ten, every ladder ending where GMS's does:
# 40 status resistance, 40% elemental, 250% DEF and +20 attack.
#
# The block and the stun on it are dropped -- nothing here blocks. Of what is
# left only the attack is worth anything: the two resistances have nothing to
# resist, and DEF is already past what it can cancel. All of it waits on the
# off hand, which for a White Knight can only be a rosary.
